<title>USA: DPL Inc says Allen Hill to be CEO.</title>
<headline>DPL Inc says Allen Hill to be CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DPL Inc said on Tuesday that Peter Forster, chairman and chief executive officer, will turn over the title of chief executive effective January 1, 1997, to Allen Hill, currently president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Forster will continue as chairman of DPL Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Hill has been president and CEO of Dayton Power and Light, DPL Inc's largest subsidiary, since 1992, the company said.</p>
</text>
